{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_title", "source_sha256": "71df9a71909397c2bfb2422918755b50accb5173dd07f4c0e6274c2c359fd112", "ja": "まっすぐに", "zh": "径直", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_synopsis", "source_sha256": "6f0d0e5bba8da3fada24135bc6b718eb1750a7a4dc1d0f8bc3ac3bfeca8f686c", "ja": "『カワイイ』がテーマのファッションショー\nに出演が決まったものの、自信がないと躊躇\nするのり子。だがファンや劇場の仲間、プロ\nデューサーの「一生可愛いと言い続ける」と\nいう言葉に背中を押され、覚悟を決める。", "zh": "虽然确定要出演以“可爱”为主题的时装秀，\n法子却因为没有自信而犹豫不决。但是在粉丝、\n剧场的同伴以及制作人“一辈子都会说你可爱”\n这番话的鼓励下，她终于下定了决心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1000_043nor", "source_sha256": "7b1e4dcf5cde8cb2d9e94a0bda01cc215e3f74348ec79d8a191303d87cdc42b5", "ja": "はぁ……。{$P$}の前だし、\nつい強がっちゃったけど……。", "zh": "唉……毕竟是在{$P$}面前，不知不觉就逞强了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "99015c2f8607348e090da58cd18bba78fe4a582028ae4c9f159dc6eee0639c57", "ja": "元気なんて全然出てないよ～！\nホントもう、どうしたらいいんだろ……。", "zh": "我根本就打不起精神来嘛～！\n真的，到底该怎么办才好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1002_norikonoani", "source_sha256": "f233e076fc26fd9f202cd55ac8e7773178263519640773cb7b325a9afa3d2e40", "ja": "おーいのり子、さっきから独り言がデカいぞ。\nんな暗い顔してどうしたんだよ。", "zh": "喂，法子，你从刚才开始自言自语的声音也太大了吧。\n摆着这么一张阴沉的脸，怎么了啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1003_norikonotiti", "source_sha256": "2f743c8b9d8a09c2514bdf9db0212bf34da4d21038b95b5786dedcc95c5fcf20", "ja": "そうだぞ～、のり子。悩みがあるならほれ、\nお父さんに何でも言ってみろ！", "zh": "没错～，法子。有烦恼的话，来，什么都跟爸爸说说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "e25d1a83f4e06ab51bce58229b6878bfa84274ed3e7fcb8edd700b4544a842ee", "ja": "兄貴、お父さん……。\nうーん、あのね、実はさ……。", "zh": "大哥，爸爸……  \n嗯——那个，其实啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1005_norikonoani", "source_sha256": "7c7094b1a6d7c9fc5c56ed5be6fd5632395efc33141d0e5a049ecbebe7046da3", "ja": "ふーん。\nまぁ元々お前、アイドルって柄じゃなかったもんな！", "zh": "哼——  \n不过你本来就不是当偶像的料嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1006_norikonotiti", "source_sha256": "581d7f366ad2c527644f8f15e1e18f9e0e786353b831eb69120ab1f53441c280", "ja": "だな。ウチのガサツ娘がアイドルになれたことが奇跡！\nここまで続くとも、正直思ってなかったしな。", "zh": "是啊。我们家那个大大咧咧的丫头能当上偶像，真是奇迹！说实话，我也没想到她能坚持到现在。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1007_norikonotiti", "source_sha256": "e1b4824fe2730005c9054b6a742e75982e03904478d1c823c6e3173b4286fc63", "ja": "だからま、ウジウジずっと悩むくらいなら、この辺で\n一般人に戻るのもいいんじゃねぇか？　なーんて……。", "zh": "所以嘛，与其一直这样纠结下去，不如就到这里\n回归普通人也不错吧？——什么的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "e9515f0062702c2757065a32d594d7cb875609ce9fdb2801814a60e7096b5830", "ja": "……うん、そうだよね。やっぱそう思うよね……。", "zh": "……嗯，也是啊。果然你也会这么想吧……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1009_norikonoani", "source_sha256": "5e7f92d03ae37de456d2a6d1ba6617e1529376100b2cd3c7f01b9d01eefe6060", "ja": "っおいおいおい、のり子！？　ら、らしくねーな！　\nそんな落ち込むなんて！　……おい、親父！", "zh": "喂喂喂，法子！？这、这可不像你啊！  \n居然会这么消沉！……喂，老爹！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1010_norikonotiti", "source_sha256": "cdfe158d01214ca332c2c1449236bfc01afd5620c806bf2b56178dbc781aaed9", "ja": "お、おおお俺のせいか！？　えーっと、のり子！\n別に俺は、アイドル辞めろとかそういう……。", "zh": "我、我我我害得吗！？呃——那个，纪子！\n我也不是说什么让你别当偶像之类的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1011_norikonohaha", "source_sha256": "7f0a5812c4f74685fd57eae1bb26fe5978ce4d99daa44cb686008126c68519ee", "ja": "ちょっとー？　お父さんもお兄ちゃんも、\nのり子に変なこと言わないの。", "zh": "喂——？爸爸和哥哥也别对我说奇怪的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1012_norikonohaha", "source_sha256": "933d9ff40fc13384006de74106320aa0756741a3278ff4051f4af8887526b254", "ja": "のり子も、急にどうしたの？\nこんな男共に相談なんかしちゃって。", "zh": "诺莉子，你怎么突然问起这个了？\n居然跑来找这种男人商量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "0d2439d1f0c88d4678d001705ec7a6146efef2d9b3c0c69f7f38f400d0182916", "ja": "やー……その、ね。アタシなんかが、\nアイドル、やってていいのかなって……。", "zh": "哎呀……那个嘛。我只是在想，\n像我这样的人，真的适合当偶像吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "564f47804863eec4ef696917e62dee10ea7ac3a941bc00fdf62aa69a24b84158", "ja": "アイドルってもっと、『カワイイ女の子』が\nやるものじゃない？　ふたりも言ってたけど……。", "zh": "偶像这种事，不是应该由更加『可爱的女孩子』来做吗？你们两个也这么说过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1015_043nor", "source_sha256": "b227bbd5bf2c9fc7d2abdd34b4de63db376b0a10b5bced01d92c0120a54ee243", "ja": "アタシみたいにガサツで乱暴で、趣味もプロレスとか\nバイクとか、そういうのじゃなくてさ……。", "zh": "像我这样粗枝大叶又粗暴，兴趣还是职业摔角和摩托车之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1016_norikonohaha", "source_sha256": "0236b8d6e3efd08726bb7fb963608b8ee3d209fb9c38c0cf7894841ecc3dd0ba", "ja": "別に、そういうアイドルの需要だって、\nないわけじゃないんでしょ？", "zh": "也不是完全没有这种偶像的需求吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1017_043nor", "source_sha256": "c1bf21c5c8d73cb4812b9c4aecc266f44bd41651113dd2ed018804de5a1c9f2c", "ja": "そうだけど、そうじゃなくて……。\nアタシが勝手に、引け目を感じちゃうっていうか……！", "zh": "是这样没错，但不是那个意思……。只是我自己不由得觉得有点自卑……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1018_norikonohaha", "source_sha256": "a2461573b391421943d461459cdaab231a9dcc708cde0cd052d08b9b583d1b02", "ja": "うーん。そりゃあ確かに、あんたの趣味は\nアイドルにしちゃ珍しいだろうし……。", "zh": "嗯——确实，你的兴趣爱好对偶像来说算是挺少见的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1019_norikonohaha", "source_sha256": "7f83bbf5c97d5a017c8e9de0fd22ce36da8ef668b218abe7cb84a83a42fe293b", "ja": "のり子が、世界一の美人か？って言われたらねぇ。\nいくら親でも、そりゃさすがに違うわって言うけど。", "zh": "要是有人问我：“则子是世界第一的美女吗？”……\n就算是她的父母，也会说，那实在是不对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1020_043nor", "source_sha256": "b22b8321f2f8054f4ef0ae4289900b81cafedde2bdcf604313c3c3fc1713893a", "ja": "うん……。", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1021_norikonohaha", "source_sha256": "12b629ba2e3b3f90d990c4c402dfad5660b8d2e7ba92eab522d2972e381cc5d8", "ja": "でも世界一の美人が、世界一のアイドルに\nなれるわけじゃないと思うんだけどね～。", "zh": "不过我觉得，世界第一的美人也不一定能成为世界第一的偶像呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1022_043nor", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1023_norikonotiti", "source_sha256": "4202e42340505677b128e3a65cf3c5609a83da6e1d7f71b34544ce01a2992ee8", "ja": "そうだな。最強無敵のレスラーだけが、\n大衆に愛されるレスラーってわけじゃないしな！", "zh": "确实如此。并不是只有最强无敌的摔跤手，才会受到大众的喜爱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1024_norikonoani", "source_sha256": "ba8a51875e108457e71709c6a5c84228a9028fff3ca84ccde51fd541fe842c8b", "ja": "ええ？　でもレスラーはやっぱ強くなきゃダメだろ！？", "zh": "诶？可是摔跤手果然还是得强才行吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1025_norikonohaha", "source_sha256": "3763229880b0fb16eb8976bc48a934018734d524b8cca88b9ca1a1f6850da73b", "ja": "ちょっと、ふたりは黙ってて！", "zh": "等等，你们两个先别说话！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1026_futari", "source_sha256": "a2c8df994dfab829f5203ad6554197f2c3623c524657767cd5575f02b0fee477", "ja": "はい……。", "zh": "好的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1027_norikonohaha", "source_sha256": "ea1511ab9b670f3d38833d86e45104814e78ea3b44fc0ccc8e842a3f788c3776", "ja": "ええっと、なんだっけ。あ、そうそう。アイドルって\n別に、美人コンテストとかじゃないんだからさ！", "zh": "呃……是什么来着。啊，对了。偶像又不是\n选美比赛之类的嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1028_norikonohaha", "source_sha256": "85e10079337df9fc103993fcd208ec2baf734006d475e7057e2d7b714dd4a330", "ja": "可愛さだけで言うなら、『隣のクラスの可愛い子』\nぐらいあれば、じゅーぶんなんじゃない？", "zh": "单论可爱程度的话，只要有“隔壁班的可爱女生”\n那种水平，不就绰绰有余了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1029_043nor", "source_sha256": "7969a2a9ecde0b664b7e46148748790365633e50c1d176941330f50723966132", "ja": "ええ～？　そうなのかな～……？", "zh": "诶诶～？是这样吗～……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1030_norikonohaha", "source_sha256": "929a7e073dbac86f38990a74ad8fce4582cd5fd6d3f21978e8f2fd4ebdb7ec67", "ja": "ま、お母さんはアイドルのことよく知らないから\nあってるかわかんないけどね！", "zh": "不过，妈妈也不太了解偶像，所以也不知道说得对不对！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1031_norikonohaha", "source_sha256": "e151060cfc85896c36b92e7f21b9ef2202da78077a96cf189a3542d7dee34cbe", "ja": "あ、お父さん！　お兄ちゃんも。\n余計なこと言って、のり子を悩ませないでよ！", "zh": "啊，爸爸！哥哥也是。\n别说多余的话，让则子烦恼啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1032_futari", "source_sha256": "1aee2e5b09f38a22d3e5187611cad85deaccc518d9eb8882250057c540226659", "ja": "は～い……。", "zh": "好～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1033_043nor", "source_sha256": "5df17ab301b34d47dfa57ba70116fbf3cc09c7e640cb980918d2be65d8711532", "ja": "も～……適当だなぁ。", "zh": "真是的～……太随便了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1034_043nor", "source_sha256": "62973d894fc5a0a022d4774412e285c74844c553e605b12996c96ec6f0d85bca", "ja": "……でも、ありがと。アタシ、\n自分がどうしたいのか、もうちょっと考えてみるよ。", "zh": "……不过，还是谢谢你啦。\n我自己到底想怎么做，我会再好好考虑一下的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1035_null", "source_sha256": "6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e", "ja": "数日後……", "zh": "过了几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1036_043nor", "source_sha256": "8fefcb61c9bd4d43e73ce5635ef6a43a76756442050483579308ccce0ff604a6", "ja": "というわけで、みんな！　アタシに力を貸して！！", "zh": "所以说，大家！来助我一臂之力吧！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1037_007ior", "source_sha256": "e37f938538e2b294a1b192008f5e76dda9b418db7e6e1f34789f08803ff62ad0", "ja": "自信のつけ方、ねぇ。", "zh": "寻找建立自信的方法啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1038_003mik", "source_sha256": "85659adc22bc393c4c09be326cec1155168458d979adc1b903320743d38ac07b", "ja": "のり子、まだ悩んでたんだ。", "zh": "原来纪子还在烦恼啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1039_043nor", "source_sha256": "c68f676aa436a350a98d405db7f6d288f9c8df7df8508be55458200414c08138", "ja": "ううっ。情けないけど、そうなんだよ～！　でも\nひとりで考えても答えが出なくて……だからお願いっ！", "zh": "呜呜。虽然很丢脸，但就是这样啦～！可是\n我一个人想也想不出答案……所以拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1040_003mik", "source_sha256": "9f1d78036df6fe303ddc626f34602dc3093b43cec57756d3b05ca2b9315f18c2", "ja": "ん～。でもミキ、あんまり自信ないってコト、\nないかも。だってミキ、カワイイし。", "zh": "嗯～。不过，美希好像也没什么不自信的时候。毕竟美希很可爱嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1041_043nor", "source_sha256": "42651f25c249da4aacb688f3de5d961510ab0938903d74490e8a482c49f2be7a", "ja": "くっ！　そのメンタルが羨ましいっ……！\nそりゃアタシも、美希ぐらい可愛かったらさぁ。", "zh": "唔！真羡慕你这股心理素质……！\n要是我也有美希那么可爱的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1042_003mik", "source_sha256": "57f6db07376c40ef51f1f175cf86f568337e4b16fff0aa3eb1670bcb06a96f16", "ja": "のり子もカワイイよ？", "zh": "纪子也很可爱呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1043_043nor", "source_sha256": "d35c1f7db13288fadc007bc92af7cb17ebf60bd57a84098637068df6872ccc7d", "ja": "だから自分でそう思うのが難しいんだって～！", "zh": "所以说，自己很难产生这种想法嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1044_029umi", "source_sha256": "d11acd444694f320caef34c5272d4d5020a57cb08e01a5c442fd74ced7277a6c", "ja": "私は、そうだなー。自信、自信……あ！できなかった\nことができるようになると、自信つくよね！？", "zh": "我嘛，这个嘛——自信，自信……啊！做不到的事变得能做到之后，就会有自信了对吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1045_029umi", "source_sha256": "aa880993d4cbf4b531bc91505348c38dfdd60e73ddc8d1daf6540783e07be9cf", "ja": "いっぱい特訓して、難しい技がきまった時とか！\n私にもできた！ってテンション上がるし☆", "zh": "比如做了好多特训，成功使出高难度招式的时候！\n就会觉得“我也做到了！”，情绪一下子就高涨起来了☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1046_043nor", "source_sha256": "d65fd74d7661eb1ed43ff762ba17cc60d2bfcb383c59b1e656936725bdf5da16", "ja": "なるほど。特訓して克服なら、納得できるかも！\n……でもこの場合、何を特訓すればいいんだろ？", "zh": "原来如此。通过特训克服的话，我也能接受！\n……不过这种情况下，到底该特训什么才好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1047_029umi", "source_sha256": "da745c08838ddc39386cbb828cc5709a3441c6acedb17bc61d52def59027c5ae", "ja": "つまり女子力トレーニングってことだよ！　\nカワイイを極めるトレーニング！　私もやりたいっ！", "zh": "也就是说，要进行女子力训练哦！\n这是锻炼如何将可爱发挥到极致！我也想参加！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1048_043nor", "source_sha256": "33fd1965af12a158dfeef303db1ab08067f6d8d0434e9354bbdcd0f1a42189d5", "ja": "女子力トレーニングか……ええっと、カワイイ服とか\nメイクとかにチャレンジしてみたり？", "zh": "女子力特训吗……呃，比如挑战一下\n穿可爱的衣服，或者化可爱的妆容之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1049_007ior", "source_sha256": "526acdb1261b66cdfcb4a578dd90faaaae2ade4416fa3cf3d4644363a6dd5ce6", "ja": "だからそんなの、仕事で山ほどやってきたじゃない。\nそれでまだ、自信がついてないって話でしょ？", "zh": "所以那些事，你不是早就在工作中做过无数次了吗？\n也就是说，即便如此，你还是没有建立起自信，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1050_043nor", "source_sha256": "6f7f3df065b052a4faacdf9fba8824d9aa1e7f820b143ec2771911a0e5f4ba80", "ja": "うっ……そうです……。", "zh": "唔……是的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1051_007ior", "source_sha256": "5676fea49905ae4c547ae174128f497f545e83fe1eb3ab0eceacf4067b2feda5", "ja": "私は、自信って覚悟みたいなものだと思うわ。\n舞台に立つ以上、自信がない、なんて言えないもの。", "zh": "我觉得，自信就像是一种觉悟。\n既然要站上舞台，就不能说自己没有自信。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1052_007ior", "source_sha256": "87a93dfa843350ff97b8df2c5894f842ac84c304e04ba3faf8f055475ef0aa3d", "ja": "たとえ自信がなくても、あるって思いこむっていうか、\nあることにするっていうか……。", "zh": "就算没有自信，也要坚信自己有自信，或者说……就当作自己有自信吧……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1053_043nor", "source_sha256": "4572fe0bc875d613adfd2b8c51fa6aad9d66cfe0c871ebfe5ee372de146114e4", "ja": "……覚悟、かぁ。", "zh": "……觉悟啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1054_032emi", "source_sha256": "39553593c99508b6bffac06ec44c6c6528df9c54b17d2eb2fba854aaf411f1cf", "ja": "あの……私はやっぱり、のり子さんの気持ち、\nわかるような気がします。", "zh": "那个……我果然还是觉得，\n自己能够理解法子小姐的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1055_032emi", "source_sha256": "fca55cee8193f82dc38d44931e13af88d44fddccaa8ab7977c3e240f2697bbf6", "ja": "憧れの大和撫子と比べて、私なんてまだまだ未熟で……\nだから、落ち込んでしまうこともあったりして。", "zh": "和我憧憬的大和抚子相比，我还远远不够成熟……\n所以，有时也会因此消沉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1056_043nor", "source_sha256": "860871b316fabc206438786213a9f3afaf010cc2b554aed9e4d66e42840817c4", "ja": "へぇ……エミリーでも、そんなことあるんだね。", "zh": "哦……没想到就连艾米莉也会有这种时候呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1057_032emi", "source_sha256": "a0372e04c33d12f0594779590372f5b5b184947fb70e7fe630f974524a6ebd97", "ja": "はい。でも私はそういう時、ごヒイキ様方から\nいただいたお手紙を読み返したりするんです。", "zh": "是的。不过每当遇到这种时候，我都会重读各位贵客寄来的信。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1058_032emi", "source_sha256": "aed7b6f36fc744181b91b13c480e5aa6849382db5ec73cad713d52472163d68b", "ja": "こんな私でも、応援してくれる人がいるんだと思うと。\n自然と背筋が伸びるというか……。", "zh": "一想到即使是这样的我，也有人愿意支持我，就会不由自主地挺直腰板……有这种感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1059_043nor", "source_sha256": "39837b3efdae22608fc0dc4f1e852f83910c2721b13ea806eb98293fd242c10c", "ja": "うん……わかるよ。ファンの人の言葉って、\nすっごくパワーもらえるよね。", "zh": "嗯……我懂。粉丝们说的话，\n真的很给人动力呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1060_043nor", "source_sha256": "e38d9e5fff8f7be51bb7420fc14c413766c17195f7f9c5407419eac0e03d137b", "ja": "正直、こんなアタシがここまでアイドル続けられたの\nだって、ファンのみんなと、仲間と。それと……。", "zh": "说实话，像我这样的人能坚持偶像活动到现在，\n也是因为有粉丝们，还有伙伴们。还有……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1061_043nor", "source_sha256": "58980f30bf5dcf34d028776ed7927b8adb807b02c1b13ca1c4f0d8d5975bc740", "ja": "それと……{$P$}が、\nずっと背中を押してくれてたからで……。", "zh": "还有……是因为一直以来都有{$P$}在背后支持我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1062_032emi", "source_sha256": "52fbc8185f6d95c7c0f5247a9629e44b653c195e3e61d22c067e5bb65f9be8ba", "ja": "そうですね。私たちに、いつも一番最初に勇気を\nくれるのは……やはり仕掛け人さま、ですよね！", "zh": "是啊。总是第一个给予我们勇气的……果然还是制作人先生，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1063_007ior", "source_sha256": "f400c93eb0189a63667f9d238a1ac4347f74764b1e842edb933203947a2e614e", "ja": "もう。どうせまだ、アイツに\nまともに相談できてないんでしょ？", "zh": "真是的。反正你肯定还没有\n正经去跟那家伙商量过吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1064_043nor", "source_sha256": "b22b8321f2f8054f4ef0ae4289900b81cafedde2bdcf604313c3c3fc1713893a", "ja": "うん……。", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1065_003mik", "source_sha256": "de38a3fc06dcdf35c8dd2231db077d023a8cee15c4ef4d7d7a0743b76e7ec49d", "ja": "{$P$}なら、さっき事務室にいるの\n見たよ？　今もいるかわかんないけど。", "zh": "{$P$}的话，我刚才看到\n他在办公室哦？虽然不知道现在还在不在。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1066_029umi", "source_sha256": "a33da8d4a4f4c7fa8f7c78dc8703eb52bdd632214d4e47bd04b3c0a4266dd939", "ja": "じゃあじゃあ、今すぐいこっ！\nのりさん、ダッシュだよ！", "zh": "那我们现在就出发吧！\n诺里，冲刺！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1067_043nor", "source_sha256": "edfc737bfb84fd9fad84b294f31d81539f306b12ad42c1c5c7a13665b7878b26", "ja": "え、え～！？　でも……。\nううん、わかった！　アタシ……行ってくる！！", "zh": "诶、诶～！？可是……\n嗯，知道了！我……这就去！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1068_p", "source_sha256": "2c005cb1577e6e522d82dc3811cb50a2857c9fcb3b8a2fc838318d3274414839", "ja": "（あれからゆっくり話せてないけど……\nのり子は大丈夫かな？　ちょっと様子でも見に……）", "zh": "（从那以后还没能好好聊聊……不知道则子还好吗？去稍微看看她的情况吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1069_se", "source_sha256": "b8703c3059553d15c7ff50eefe79011dd74b664f4b3aff75b2aa244af9dbf40e", "ja": "ガチャッ！", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1070_043nor", "source_sha256": "6ea64047dafd91022303c7e102794668cad2d847db557acad48f10a505eec740", "ja": "{$P$}！　って、うわあっ！", "zh": "{$P$}！……等等，哇啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1071_p", "source_sha256": "a29e5437677711217ab7a3bacddcd0852738648bc3831e28264a764cf5afaea0", "ja": "うおっ！", "zh": "哇！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1072_043nor", "source_sha256": "7bf7f8ac445faacfb67fde42dcbc570bbdeac022ef5296e884bef33037792716", "ja": "っとっと……危なかったぁ～。\nえへへ、今度はセーフ！", "zh": "哎呀呀……好险啊～。\n嘿嘿，这次算安全过关！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1073_p", "source_sha256": "c4838f9de98460a3ddb813617153cee0a411d17d9cace2da92d60616a8d49956", "ja": "セーフだけど、危ないから\n次からはちゃんとノックしてくれよ？", "zh": "虽然没出事，但很危险啊。\n下次记得好好敲门，行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1074_043nor", "source_sha256": "c2bbdb31dd21a796a4c9c47c2257aa08fdcca1f2621a8b9c44a20e94c589c843", "ja": "いやー、ごめん！\n勢いつけなきゃ話せそうになくて、つい……。", "zh": "哎呀，抱歉！\n我不一口气冲过来就开不了口，所以不由得……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1075_p", "source_sha256": "8706602d8c4fe8865645502186a6e24a1b18105ba265aa51f9590827cd4d8252", "ja": "話って……JCCの件か？", "zh": "有话说……是JCC那件事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1076_043nor", "source_sha256": "91cb5592ce314653b35997ef9e3bd1de0d4c87e6b19556f19d5fae07bae95a4f", "ja": "あーうん、JCCもそうなんだけど、その……\n{$P$}！", "zh": "啊——嗯，JCC的事也是，不过那个……{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1077_043nor", "source_sha256": "e611a8c7e8fd9b116019a8b033cf26f4a4b63ae8be6da8132658aa71d4ff3891", "ja": "アタシね、やっぱまだ、うまく自信持てないの！\n自分が……か、カワイイって！", "zh": "我啊，果然还是没法好好地建立自信！\n说自己……可、可爱什么的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1078_p", "source_sha256": "fe96b413c808e95399e2f3f7b7ae5316c11dbd0893c1e10e51247cbaaa03bbe1", "ja": "……そうか。", "zh": "……这样啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1079_043nor", "source_sha256": "75e89a307f5c152eae550223e9f2e4e38bbefb402f64120942c677316be5db36", "ja": "ホント、今さらだよね！？　カワイイなんて、\nもう何度も言ってもらってるのにさ。", "zh": "真的，事到如今才说这个，不觉得太晚了吗！？明明已经被说过好多次可爱了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1080_043nor", "source_sha256": "35fd8d5bae0016bb2f41d1f45f0d1a376817b804e847c0e9812c6ed5acd823d7", "ja": "{$P$}とか、ファンのみんなの言葉が\n嘘じゃないってのは、わかってるんだけど……。", "zh": "我知道像{$P$}这样的，还有粉丝们说的话，都不是假的，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1081_p", "source_sha256": "4af7926c28dff5fb7065b73f192ae97f46182b605fcb4f6a3dd48327995dddfc", "ja": "ああ。もちろん本気で可愛いって思ってるよ。\nのり子の事。", "zh": "啊，我当然是真心觉得很可爱。\n是说诺莉子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1082_043nor", "source_sha256": "c85fa84f2b4391dff4900281666c4cfb521cad7d3e216d8e20709e7760e94328", "ja": "うっ……。で、でもやっぱ、アタシってそういう\nキャラじゃないから……。", "zh": "唔……但、但我果然不是\n那种人设啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1083_043nor", "source_sha256": "2381ad59d64c5f64546edc3249e1e30f15da019adcec0c2fd8636eb0ba0c695d", "ja": "だから……もしかしたら一生、\n自信持てないかもしれなくて。それで……。", "zh": "所以……说不定我这一辈子都没法建立自信。所以……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1084_043nor", "source_sha256": "6b799fe3723d32b88a8629bd1c2844a8c2a891cfa16d9e8ac634edbfdbb12bdd", "ja": "そんなアタシが、ホントに……\nアイドル、続けていいのかなって……！", "zh": "这样的我，真的还可以……继续当偶像吗……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1085_p", "source_sha256": "ffb5af7b47e9e8698214ca65e81b9397b44d0df0848e0fcef7bead2e1352cecc", "ja": "もちろん、いいに決まってる。\n自信がなくたって、のり子が可愛いのは事実なんだし。", "zh": "当然可以，肯定可以。\n即使你没有自信，诺莉子的可爱也是事实。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1086_p", "source_sha256": "7b197a36156ee5f99539a9fb9131bb19fa2efdb8da161b19fb303c469aa9e09f", "ja": "それに、そういう事に自信が持てないのり子だから、\n応援したいって思うファンもいるはずだ。", "zh": "而且，正因为纪子对这种事没有自信，才一定也有想为她加油的粉丝。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1087_043nor", "source_sha256": "5c3f32d2ddf42fc63508f8aa81ffdd5ec6c572ee6843a1784402affea3f8a4b1", "ja": "で、でも！　こんなことで、自信がなくて\nウジウジしてるやつがさ！　トップアイドルなんて……", "zh": "可、可是！像这样因为这点事就没自信、扭扭捏捏的家伙！怎么可能成为顶级偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1088_043nor", "source_sha256": "1fb2fc48f3b0f074d21111d3aec80479c43c68c68111d4aaf77e5a430ec391a4", "ja": "トップアイドルなんて……\nなれないに、決まってるよ……。", "zh": "顶级偶像什么的……\n肯定当不成啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1089_p", "source_sha256": "cd0eefac717d148df18945d65218e6358c1d8358e9cf983835a1ca761c825371", "ja": "わかった。のり子が自信を持てないっていうなら、\nその分、俺が可愛いって言い続けるよ。", "zh": "我知道了。既然法子说自己没有自信，\n那我就加倍不断夸你可爱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1090_p", "source_sha256": "31ae84265d931abd9887496516b62c28161b2e285997ebfcd3534a9e3edc1907", "ja": "一生自信が持てないっていうなら、\n一生言い続ける！", "zh": "要是一辈子都没法拥有自信，那我就会说一辈子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1091_043nor", "source_sha256": "c6336e9e29be12f38202db6a806c05164c4b8028068a2f489ce53d8c885330c5", "ja": "いっ……いいい、一生っ！！？", "zh": "一……一一一、一生！！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1092_p", "source_sha256": "0cd98698b8b1e6599ffb979ba70c8af71f7028296cb9fa133d8f0dbfb8a8b307", "ja": "ああ。のり子が今も自信持てないのは、\n俺のプロデュースのせいでもあるだろうし……。", "zh": "是啊。纪子现在还没有自信，也有一部分是因为我的制作方式吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1093_p", "source_sha256": "f2a42c843c7920b1e5cfcb7e312faffaebb3c41019758101e7554eeede356eac", "ja": "だから、ちゃんと責任取るよ。\nのり子が、なりたい自分になれるまで！", "zh": "所以，我会好好负起责任的。\n直到纪子成为自己想成为的那个人为止！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1094_043nor", "source_sha256": "77494962a22402d0760341f8dd5543901b5cb2e374494ad5f9f502b3ab6f5481", "ja": "はぁ……。{$P$}って、\n時々、とんでもないこと言うよね……。", "zh": "唉……{$P$}有时候还真会说些不得了的话呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1095_p", "source_sha256": "76f1e76d6eeb0d4a7c98de00d25f0db4eb3190e0600283445869faa1e7681264", "ja": "そうか？　プロデューサーとしては、\n当然の事を言ってるまでだと思うけど……。", "zh": "是吗？我只是觉得，作为制作人，说这些是理所当然的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1096_043nor", "source_sha256": "3981f437154f0c4f2ea1aaa70863c1127e004fc126161adbebf4674316858c7e", "ja": "も～～、そういうトコ……。でも、わかった。\n{$P$}がそう言ってくれるなら……。", "zh": "真是的～，你就是这样……不过，我知道了。既然{$P$}都这么说了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_151_1097_043nor", "source_sha256": "2c1bf05cbe5b21f95b5e2fb485c30b0a86566dbc61f072b256d4691961a4ed4d", "ja": "アタシも、覚悟決めるよ！　へへっ。", "zh": "我也会下定决心的！嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
